        {
          "text": "mu­ mwaka mutaanzi wabwami bwakwe, mebo nde-Daniele ndakamvwa makani aamumabuku. Ndakamvwa mweelwe wamyaka, ijwi lya-Jehova ngulyakaambila musinsimi Jeremiya, myaka iyakeelede kuzuzikizigwa mane kusaalwa kwa-Jerusalemu kukamane, nkokuti myaka iili makumi aali musanu aabili.",
          "type": "text",
