                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teetwakaswiilila balanda bako basinsimi ibakaamba muzina lyako, ibakaambila bami besu abasilutwe besu abamatateesu abantu boonse banyika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulinduwe, O mwami, kulajanwa bululami, anu kulindiswe kulajanwa bweeme buyo, mbubonya mbokubede sunu. Bafwa bweeme bantu ba-Juda, abaabo bakede mu-Jerusalemu, aba-Israyeli boonse nebaba bali afwiifwi nebaba bali kule, muzisi zyoonse nkowakabatandila nkaambo kalupapilo lwabo ndobakakupapila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twafwa bweeme, O mwami, bami besu abasilutwe besu abamatateesu boonse, nkaambo tulikubisizizye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
