          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwabikwa insondo zili makumi aali musanu aabili kubantu bako akumunzi uusalala, kuti insotoko zimane azibi zimanisigwe, milandu yabubi ilobelele, bululami buteeli buletwe, cilengano camusinsimi cizuzikizigwe, abusena busalalisya bunanikwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino uleelede kuziba akumvwisya kuti, kuzwa kuciindi camulazyo wakubusya awakuyakulula Jerusalemu kusikila kuciindi cakusika kwamwami uunanikidwe, kuyooba insondo zili musanu azibili. Lino insondo zili makumi aali musanu alimwi ansondo zyobile uuyooyakululwa, uyooba amigwagwa amufolo wakuutabilila, muziindi zyamapenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
